# .trivyignore — accepted container vulnerabilities (#1651).
#
# Every entry MUST have:
#   * the CVE / GHSA / misconfiguration id
#   * an `exp:` expiry date (max 90 days out) so the exception is re-reviewed
#   * a comment with justification, owner, and tracking issue
#
# Example:
#   # Not reachable: only affects the `foo` CLI, which is not in the runtime image.
#   # Owner: @security-team  Tracking: #1234
#   CVE-2024-00000 exp:2026-12-31
